      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GUARDRAILS ON THE LOOP \u2014 interviewers probe this\n  \u00b7 step / token / cost caps per run\n  \u00b7 loop detection by (tool, args) hash\n  \u00b7 human stays the approver \u2014 agent never merges\n  \u00b7 idempotency so a replayed webhook doesn't double-post",
      "originalText": "GUARDRAILS ON THE LOOP \u2014 interviewers probe this\n  \u00b7 step / token / cost caps per run\n  \u00b7 loop detection by (tool, args) hash\n  \u00b7 human stays the approver \u2014 agent never merges\n  \u00b7 idempotency so a replayed webhook doesn't double-post",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "el1179291461",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
