      "updated": 1785000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Metric: PR-opened \u2192 first human review comment.\nNOT merge time \u2014 say which interval you measured.\nNamed confounder: an auto-assign-reviewer bot landed in\nthe same window. Split the credit explicitly, unprompted \u2014\nthat split is what makes the number believable.",
      "originalText": "Metric: PR-opened \u2192 first human review comment.\nNOT merge time \u2014 say which interval you measured.\nNamed confounder: an auto-assign-reviewer bot landed in\nthe same window. Split the credit explicitly, unprompted \u2014\nthat split is what makes the number believable.",
