      "text": "MCP TIMELINE \u2014 fix this before someone does the subtraction\nMCP was announced 25 Nov 2024; the engagement ended Jan 2025.\nThe orchestration ran the full engagement on plain function-calling;\nMCP came in near the end. Say it that way.",
